{"id":"e92d50fae9055cf8","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-schema.md","title":"Schema","display":"df-schema — Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-schema","aliases":["92-df-schema"],"display":"df-schema — Schema","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schema — Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (template domain, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula-template map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Schema}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Schema}_G\\)</span> (definition-target schema constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schema} \\vdash \\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)\\coloneqq\\{T(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in D\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schema} \\vdash \\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)\\coloneqq\\{T(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in D\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Schema}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Schema}(T)\\)</span> : 公理模式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>生成的公理集</li>\n<li>公理模式是&quot;模板&quot;，生成无限多条公理</li>\n<li>例：归纳模式、命题逻辑公理模式</li>\n<li>模板<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是公式结构上的模板</li>\n<li>任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 与映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 生成的模式未必可判定</li>\n<li>只有当模板域、实例化过程以及实例解析均有效且成员检验可判定时，模式生成的公理集才可判定；PA 的标准归纳模式满足这些附加条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (template domain, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Schema}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}schema} \\vdash \\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)\\coloneqq\\{T(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in D\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Schema}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1033,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd304cf92255e65e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ and $T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (syntactic template domain and map, see [[92-df-schema]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9